Make a folder: /projects/<slug>/ (e.g., radio-console).

Copy the template: Paste _template/index.html into that folder and edit:

Title, date, tags, text sections.

Update gallery image filenames.

Add images: Drop your .jpg/.png into that folder. Use cover.jpg for the main thumbnail.

Update the list: Append an entry to /projects/projects.json with the same slug and thumb path.

Commit & push. The home page will pull from the JSON and show your new card automatically.